[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2186.069, "timestamp": "00:36:26", "text": "對吧？ 24小時直播馬拉松。然後，它提醒我，如果我當初做了我腦子裡想的那個主意，如果我不去害怕別人怎麼想，而是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2188.71, "timestamp": "00:36:28", "text": "去做，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2190.47, "timestamp": "00:36:30", "text": "我或許也能獲得一些觀看時長，也能真正有所收穫，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2200.43, "timestamp": "00:36:40", "text": "我會覺得我沒有為此付出努力"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2203.27, "timestamp": "00:36:43", "text": "。某種程度上，我只是跳過了努力的過程，對吧？我不知道這種感覺是好是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2206.911, "timestamp": "00:36:46", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "start planning out stuff properly and adhere to it"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2209.67, "timestamp": "00:36:49", "text": "壞。但，是的，我不知道。說實話，從Jockathon獲得YouTube合作夥伴資格感覺還不錯，因為我真的投入了時間和精力來做"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2218.947, "timestamp": "00:36:58", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "not \"i'll play this game for 10hrs straight\""}]